From 02f9b55f536f3d3ca2c4a79fef185e538071635b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:06:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/backup: Bound backup parsing to the project's disk
 budget
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reading the backup index decompressed the whole archive with no bound,
so a small compressed upload could keep the decompressor and the daemon
busy producing data far past anything the project could store.

This addresses GHSA-9pvj-5r2h-r873 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 9338bdd95586079d42c644bd931c673265ce4346)
